#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:5 57043953d1164945bed7a0d0f9cf1622
msgid "Trademark"
msgstr "商标"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:7 ed35772939bf41aa91b4488a272692f5
msgid "\"ArduPilot\" is a registered trademark in the United States."
msgstr "「ArduPilot」 是在美国注册的商标。"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:9 f1b4fa47963e456daac78d233f994298
msgid ""
"As mentioned on the `License page <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-"
"gplv3.html>`__ we greatly appreciate those companies and individuals who "
"have incorporated the ArduPilot software into their products for sale. A "
"significant number have already done this and we expect many more to follow."
msgstr ""
"如 `许可证页面 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-gplv3.html>`__ 所述，我们非常感谢那些将"
" ArduPilot 软件集成到其产品中并进行销售的公司和个人。已有相当数量的企业和个人这样做了，我们期待更多人加入。"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:12 48c47e05f8a843d0a0035fc4c8349582
msgid ""
"In general, the development team encourages the use of \"ArduPilot\" on "
"products and services which incorporate the ArduPilot software but we "
"request the following:"
msgstr "总体而言，开发团队鼓励在集成了 ArduPilot 软件的产品和服务中使用 「ArduPilot」 名称，但我们提出以下要求："

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:14 af54e0bda1f5443d9db95cdca55a47c6
msgid ""
"The company has thoroughly tested the product with ArduPilot and provides "
"after sales support to the buyer"
msgstr "公司已使用 ArduPilot 对产品进行过充分测试，并向购买者提供售后支持"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:15 55dae44ca80946fc936891ada83723d2
msgid ""
"An official stable release of ArduPilot is used or a release sanctioned by "
"one of the members of the ArduPilot development team"
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 官方稳定发布版，或经 ArduPilot 开发团队成员认可的发布版本"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:16 642dc4871dca4894a86e77d2865c843a
msgid ""
"The `ArduPilot license <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-"
"gplv3.html>`__ is followed including allowing the owner of the product to "
"upload custom or newer versions of ArduPilot to the flight controller (these"
" custom versions do not actually need to work but it should be possible to "
"upload them)"
msgstr ""
"遵循 `ArduPilot 许可证 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/license-"
"gplv3.html>`__，包括允许产品所有者将自定义或更新版本的 ArduPilot 上传到飞控（这些自定义版本不必实际可用，但应能上传）"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:17 7d846f238cbe439285e09338d3b9d968
msgid "The product is not intended to cause harm to people or property"
msgstr "该产品不以伤害人员或财产为目的"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:18 70012e269e1e4f4b9f02cfb8c3d42305
msgid ""
"Please consider `becoming an ArduPilot partner "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ to support the ongoing development"
" and support of ArduPilot"
msgstr ""
"请考虑 `成为 ArduPilot 合作伙伴 <https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__，以支持 "
"ArduPilot 的持续开发和维护"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:20 2d26424fefbb4eadaf12619b4ec5a4f9
msgid ""
"If you have any further questions about using ArduPilot on your product, "
"please get in touch with Andrew Tridgell or Randy Mackay through one of the "
"methods listed on our `Contact Us page "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-contact-us.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果您对在产品中使用 ArduPilot 有任何其他问题，请通过我们 `联系我们页面 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-contact-us.html>`__ 上列出的方式联系 "
"Andrew Tridgell 或 Randy Mackay。"

#: ../../source/docs/trademark.rst:22 1f5307bf0a644f219125624faa825c5d
msgid ""
"Below is the logo we use.  Other file types are available `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/logos>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下是我们使用的徽标。其他文件格式可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/tree/master/logos>`__ 获取。"
